        <content type="html" xml:base="https://viveksabale1998.github.io/projects/qnn-classification/">&lt;h1 id=&quot;quantum-state-classification-using-qnn&quot;&gt;Quantum State Classification Using QNN&lt;&#x2F;h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This project implements parameterised quantum circuits (PQCs) and quantum neural networks for entanglement and separability classification of multi-qubit quantum states. Developed in collaboration with Thirumalai and Diksha Sharma.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;project-actions&quot; style=&quot;margin: 1.5rem 0; display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;&quot;&gt;
  &lt;a href=&quot;https:&#x2F;&#x2F;github.com&#x2F;Thirumalai-97&#x2F;QuantumStateClassification_UsingQNN&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; class=&quot;c-button c-button--primary c-button--small&quot; style=&quot;text-decoration: none;&quot;&gt;
    &lt;i class=&quot;ion ion-logo-github&quot; style=&quot;margin-right: 6px;&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;i&gt; View Repository on GitHub
  &lt;&#x2F;a&gt;
&lt;&#x2F;div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;pushpin-key-highlights&quot;&gt;📌 Key Highlights&lt;&#x2F;h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Variational Architectures&lt;&#x2F;strong&gt;: Designs and tests ansatz structures optimized for state classification tasks.&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entanglement Detection&lt;&#x2F;strong&gt;: High-accuracy boundary identification distinguishing entangled from separable state geometries.&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Noise Resilience&lt;&#x2F;strong&gt;: Evaluated under depolarizing and amplitude damping noise channels on simulated backends.&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;&#x2F;ul&gt;
